# LeakSanitizer's suppressions for calib's tests, under VC_SANITIZE
# (tests/CMakeLists.txt).
#
# OpenCV 5.0.0's StdMatAllocator::allocate (core/src/matrix.cpp) takes a Mat's
# buffer from fastMalloc, then news its UMatData: when that new throws, as the
# out-of-memory tests make it, the buffer leaks. A Mat calib leaked would
# still show, as its UMatData.
leak:cv::fastMalloc
